# .gitignore for SLDS 42.510 project 1.3
# Put this file in the project folder (next to .Renviron) BEFORE the first `git add`.

# Secrets: the LTA key, the alert URL and any other keys live here. Never commit.
.Renviron
.env

# Data: too large for Git. LTA serves only the current state, so back up data_raw/ separately.
# data_raw_*/: catch-all for any other data_raw_ copy
# data_raw/: whole network + other feeds (lta-collector)
# data_raw_expressway/: expressway pages every 2 min (lta-collector-expressway)
# data_raw_desktop/: 14-16 Oct copied from the Windows desktop
data_raw_*/
data_raw/
data_raw_expressway/
data_raw_desktop/
data_processed/
# Packed daily tars and upload log (upload_raw.sh); the copy lives on Google Drive
archive_raw/

# Figures are regenerated by code. Delete this line when you commit the final figures.
figures/

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Old files kept on your machine only
_superseded/

# Temporary and system files
*.partial
~$*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Kept locally, never shared (the repo is public): project_docs/ holds the course documents (brief, catalog),
# our submitted proposal, and our working notes: CHANGELOG.md (working log of decisions; final ones also go in
# DECISIONS.md), TODO.md, the proposal workbook. The names below are a safety net in case a copy lands elsewhere.
# The report/ folder itself stays in Git for the final report.
project_docs/
TODO.md
CHANGELOG.md
docs/COLLECTION_REVIEW_2026-10-16.md
report/proposal_workbook.md
